{"video_id": "i1zr8Svaaog", "channel_id": "UClzcGZhMyjX5BVDXk4fmiNg", "fetched_at": "2026-11-17T03:38:37.449506+00:00", "fetch_tool": "yt-dlp 2026.08.19", "caption_track_type": "auto_generated", "segments": [{"start_seconds": 0.65, "end_seconds": 2.67, "text": "[music]"}, {"start_seconds": 3.0, "end_seconds": 7.4, "text": ">> Cost allocation tags turn resource"}, {"start_seconds": 5.48, "end_seconds": 10.12, "text": "labels into useful cost reporting"}, {"start_seconds": 7.4, "end_seconds": 12.92, "text": "dimensions, helping you analyze AWS"}, {"start_seconds": 10.12, "end_seconds": 14.24, "text": "spending by organizational ownership or"}, {"start_seconds": 12.92, "end_seconds": 16.84, "text": "by the identity that launched a"}, {"start_seconds": 14.24, "end_seconds": 16.84, "text": "resource."}, {"start_seconds": 17.6, "end_seconds": 22.28, "text": "Start with a central idea."}, {"start_seconds": 19.76, "end_seconds": 24.48, "text": "A tag attached to an AWS resource is a"}, {"start_seconds": 22.28, "end_seconds": 26.12, "text": "resource management label. It does not"}, {"start_seconds": 24.48, "end_seconds": 27.52, "text": "automatically become a billing report"}, {"start_seconds": 26.12, "end_seconds": 29.24, "text": "dimension."}, {"start_seconds": 27.52, "end_seconds": 30.52, "text": "First, apply the tag to the relevant"}, {"start_seconds": 29.24, "end_seconds": 32.32, "text": "resources."}, {"start_seconds": 30.52, "end_seconds": 33.72, "text": "Next, activate that tag for cost"}, {"start_seconds": 32.32, "end_seconds": 34.92, "text": "allocation in billing and cost"}, {"start_seconds": 33.72, "end_seconds": 36.84, "text": "management."}, {"start_seconds": 34.92, "end_seconds": 39.0, "text": "After the information becomes available,"}, {"start_seconds": 36.84, "end_seconds": 42.08, "text": "use the available tag in Cost Explorer"}, {"start_seconds": 39.0, "end_seconds": 44.2, "text": "to filter or analyze associated costs."}, {"start_seconds": 42.08, "end_seconds": 46.16, "text": "This distinction between tagging and"}, {"start_seconds": 44.2, "end_seconds": 49.16, "text": "activation is one of the most important"}, {"start_seconds": 46.16, "end_seconds": 51.0, "text": "exam points in this topic."}, {"start_seconds": 49.16, "end_seconds": 52.16, "text": "There are two tag categories to"}, {"start_seconds": 51.0, "end_seconds": 53.76, "text": "distinguish."}, {"start_seconds": 52.16, "end_seconds": 55.88, "text": "User-defined tags are created and"}, {"start_seconds": 53.76, "end_seconds": 57.56, "text": "applied by your organization."}, {"start_seconds": 55.88, "end_seconds": 60.12, "text": "They work well for internal allocation"}, {"start_seconds": 57.56, "end_seconds": 62.96, "text": "models, such as department, team,"}, {"start_seconds": 60.12, "end_seconds": 64.64, "text": "application, environment, or project."}, {"start_seconds": 62.96, "end_seconds": 67.0, "text": "For example, department equals"}, {"start_seconds": 64.64, "end_seconds": 68.16, "text": "operations is a user-defined business"}, {"start_seconds": 67.0, "end_seconds": 70.88, "text": "label."}, {"start_seconds": 68.16, "end_seconds": 73.08, "text": "AWS-generated tags work differently."}, {"start_seconds": 70.88, "end_seconds": 75.12, "text": "AWS supplies their structure, rather"}, {"start_seconds": 73.08, "end_seconds": 77.4, "text": "than the organization defining it."}, {"start_seconds": 75.12, "end_seconds": 79.56, "text": "Eligible AWS-generated tags can still be"}, {"start_seconds": 77.4, "end_seconds": 81.16, "text": "activated for cost allocation, but you"}, {"start_seconds": 79.56, "end_seconds": 83.68, "text": "do not control their definitions in the"}, {"start_seconds": 81.16, "end_seconds": 83.68, "text": "same way."}, {"start_seconds": 83.76, "end_seconds": 88.2, "text": "Here is the practical workflow."}, {"start_seconds": 85.92, "end_seconds": 89.32, "text": "First, tag the resources you want to"}, {"start_seconds": 88.2, "end_seconds": 92.08, "text": "analyze."}, {"start_seconds": 89.32, "end_seconds": 94.88, "text": "Second, open Billing and Cost Management"}, {"start_seconds": 92.08, "end_seconds": 96.96, "text": "and navigate to Cost Allocation Tags."}, {"start_seconds": 94.88, "end_seconds": 99.88, "text": "Third, locate the tag under either"}, {"start_seconds": 96.96, "end_seconds": 102.76, "text": "user-defined or AWS-generated,"}, {"start_seconds": 99.88, "end_seconds": 105.32, "text": "then activate it for cost allocation."}, {"start_seconds": 102.76, "end_seconds": 107.76, "text": "Finally, after data is available, open"}, {"start_seconds": 105.32, "end_seconds": 109.92, "text": "Cost Explorer, select the tag key,"}, {"start_seconds": 107.76, "end_seconds": 111.36, "text": "choose the specific tag value, and apply"}, {"start_seconds": 109.92, "end_seconds": 113.52, "text": "the filter."}, {"start_seconds": 111.36, "end_seconds": 115.6, "text": "The order matters. Cost Explorer is"}, {"start_seconds": 113.52, "end_seconds": 118.6, "text": "where you analyze cost data, not where"}, {"start_seconds": 115.6, "end_seconds": 118.6, "text": "you activate the tag."}, {"start_seconds": 119.84, "end_seconds": 124.97, "text": "In the console, think billing and cost"}, {"start_seconds": 122.29, "end_seconds": 127.61, "text": "management as the activation location."}, {"start_seconds": 124.97, "end_seconds": 129.45, "text": "Navigate to cost allocation tags and"}, {"start_seconds": 127.61, "end_seconds": 131.17, "text": "locate the relevant entry under the"}, {"start_seconds": 129.45, "end_seconds": 132.73, "text": "appropriate category."}, {"start_seconds": 131.17, "end_seconds": 136.05, "text": "A department tag created by your"}, {"start_seconds": 132.73, "end_seconds": 138.81, "text": "organization appears as user-defined."}, {"start_seconds": 136.05, "end_seconds": 140.01, "text": "A tag such as created by is AWS"}, {"start_seconds": 138.81, "end_seconds": 142.21, "text": "generated."}, {"start_seconds": 140.01, "end_seconds": 144.29, "text": "Activate the one you need for reporting."}, {"start_seconds": 142.21, "end_seconds": 146.37, "text": "Cost Explorer uses that enabled cost"}, {"start_seconds": 144.29, "end_seconds": 148.57, "text": "allocation dimension later when you need"}, {"start_seconds": 146.37, "end_seconds": 151.37, "text": "to inspect spending by a tag key and a"}, {"start_seconds": 148.57, "end_seconds": 153.77, "text": "selected value."}, {"start_seconds": 151.37, "end_seconds": 155.57, "text": "Suppose a cloud operations team needs to"}, {"start_seconds": 153.77, "end_seconds": 156.73, "text": "see spending assigned to the operations"}, {"start_seconds": 155.57, "end_seconds": 158.81, "text": "department."}, {"start_seconds": 156.73, "end_seconds": 161.37, "text": "Apply a user-defined tag with the key"}, {"start_seconds": 158.81, "end_seconds": 163.25, "text": "department and the value operations to"}, {"start_seconds": 161.37, "end_seconds": 164.97, "text": "the relevant resources."}, {"start_seconds": 163.25, "end_seconds": 166.81, "text": "Then activate the department tag for"}, {"start_seconds": 164.97, "end_seconds": 169.17, "text": "cost allocation."}, {"start_seconds": 166.81, "end_seconds": 171.25, "text": "In Cost Explorer, select department as"}, {"start_seconds": 169.17, "end_seconds": 173.57, "text": "the tag key, choose the operations"}, {"start_seconds": 171.25, "end_seconds": 175.17, "text": "value, and apply the filter."}, {"start_seconds": 173.57, "end_seconds": 176.25, "text": "The resulting view supports a business"}, {"start_seconds": 175.17, "end_seconds": 179.41, "text": "question."}, {"start_seconds": 176.25, "end_seconds": 181.17, "text": "What AWS spending belongs to operations?"}, {"start_seconds": 179.41, "end_seconds": 184.49, "text": "That question is different from asking"}, {"start_seconds": 181.17, "end_seconds": 184.49, "text": "who launched the resources."}, {"start_seconds": 184.81, "end_seconds": 190.57, "text": "For a creator attribution question, use"}, {"start_seconds": 187.41, "end_seconds": 193.09, "text": "the AWS generated created by tag."}, {"start_seconds": 190.57, "end_seconds": 194.69, "text": "This tag helps associate resource costs"}, {"start_seconds": 193.09, "end_seconds": 196.41, "text": "with the identity connected to launching"}, {"start_seconds": 194.69, "end_seconds": 198.65, "text": "the resource."}, {"start_seconds": 196.41, "end_seconds": 201.33, "text": "The value can show an IAM user, which"}, {"start_seconds": 198.65, "end_seconds": 204.05, "text": "may indicate an individual user session."}, {"start_seconds": 201.33, "end_seconds": 206.01, "text": "But it may instead show an assumed role."}, {"start_seconds": 204.05, "end_seconds": 208.17, "text": "For example, a resource launched through"}, {"start_seconds": 206.01, "end_seconds": 210.33, "text": "CloudFormation can be associated with a"}, {"start_seconds": 208.17, "end_seconds": 212.37, "text": "role used by that process."}, {"start_seconds": 210.33, "end_seconds": 214.53, "text": "Therefore, created by does not always"}, {"start_seconds": 212.37, "end_seconds": 216.21, "text": "identify a named human being. It can"}, {"start_seconds": 214.53, "end_seconds": 219.05, "text": "identify the role context behind"}, {"start_seconds": 216.21, "end_seconds": 221.33, "text": "automated activity."}, {"start_seconds": 219.05, "end_seconds": 223.65, "text": "Use the reporting requirement to select"}, {"start_seconds": 221.33, "end_seconds": 225.37, "text": "the appropriate tag. For internal"}, {"start_seconds": 223.65, "end_seconds": 227.29, "text": "business allocation, choose a"}, {"start_seconds": 225.37, "end_seconds": 229.05, "text": "user-defined tag because your"}, {"start_seconds": 227.29, "end_seconds": 230.25, "text": "organization controls the meaning and"}, {"start_seconds": 229.05, "end_seconds": 232.33, "text": "values."}, {"start_seconds": 230.25, "end_seconds": 233.89, "text": "Department, project, and environment are"}, {"start_seconds": 232.33, "end_seconds": 236.41, "text": "common examples."}, {"start_seconds": 233.89, "end_seconds": 238.81, "text": "For creator attribution, choose the AWS"}, {"start_seconds": 236.41, "end_seconds": 240.85, "text": "generated created by tag. It helps"}, {"start_seconds": 238.81, "end_seconds": 243.25, "text": "identify the user or assumed role"}, {"start_seconds": 240.85, "end_seconds": 245.21, "text": "associated with launching resources."}, {"start_seconds": 243.25, "end_seconds": 246.89, "text": "These are complementary views."}, {"start_seconds": 245.21, "end_seconds": 249.45, "text": "A department tag tells you which"}, {"start_seconds": 246.89, "end_seconds": 251.37, "text": "organizational area owns spending."}, {"start_seconds": 249.45, "end_seconds": 253.53, "text": "Created by helps investigate which"}, {"start_seconds": 251.37, "end_seconds": 255.81, "text": "identity or automation context initiated"}, {"start_seconds": 253.53, "end_seconds": 255.81, "text": "it."}, {"start_seconds": 256.13, "end_seconds": 260.61, "text": "Watch for four common traps."}, {"start_seconds": 258.45, "end_seconds": 262.57, "text": "First, assigning a tag to a resource"}, {"start_seconds": 260.61, "end_seconds": 264.25, "text": "does not automatically make it available"}, {"start_seconds": 262.57, "end_seconds": 266.53, "text": "for billing analysis."}, {"start_seconds": 264.25, "end_seconds": 269.13, "text": "Activation is still required."}, {"start_seconds": 266.53, "end_seconds": 271.61, "text": "Second, in Cost Explorer, selecting a"}, {"start_seconds": 269.13, "end_seconds": 273.41, "text": "tag key is not a complete filter. Choose"}, {"start_seconds": 271.61, "end_seconds": 275.97, "text": "the tag value as well."}, {"start_seconds": 273.41, "end_seconds": 277.21, "text": "Third, do not assume created by always"}, {"start_seconds": 275.97, "end_seconds": 279.45, "text": "means a person."}, {"start_seconds": 277.21, "end_seconds": 281.37, "text": "A role value is valid, including a role"}, {"start_seconds": 279.45, "end_seconds": 283.77, "text": "used by CloudFormation."}, {"start_seconds": 281.37, "end_seconds": 286.29, "text": "Finally, if a recently activated tag has"}, {"start_seconds": 283.77, "end_seconds": 287.89, "text": "no visible cost data, allow time before"}, {"start_seconds": 286.29, "end_seconds": 290.85, "text": "concluding that the resource tagging or"}, {"start_seconds": 287.89, "end_seconds": 290.85, "text": "activation failed."}, {"start_seconds": 292.09, "end_seconds": 296.61, "text": "When an expected Cost Explorer result is"}, {"start_seconds": 294.49, "end_seconds": 299.33, "text": "missing, troubleshoot in a disciplined"}, {"start_seconds": 296.61, "end_seconds": 301.53, "text": "order. First, verify that the expected"}, {"start_seconds": 299.33, "end_seconds": 302.73, "text": "resources actually have the required tag"}, {"start_seconds": 301.53, "end_seconds": 305.33, "text": "and value."}, {"start_seconds": 302.73, "end_seconds": 307.61, "text": "Second, confirm that tag is activated as"}, {"start_seconds": 305.33, "end_seconds": 310.45, "text": "a cost allocation tag in billing and"}, {"start_seconds": 307.61, "end_seconds": 312.33, "text": "cost management. Third, allow time for"}, {"start_seconds": 310.45, "end_seconds": 313.69, "text": "cost data and activation processing to"}, {"start_seconds": 312.33, "end_seconds": 316.09, "text": "become available."}, {"start_seconds": 313.69, "end_seconds": 317.77, "text": "Finally, return to Cost Explorer and"}, {"start_seconds": 316.09, "end_seconds": 320.13, "text": "confirm that you selected both the tag"}, {"start_seconds": 317.77, "end_seconds": 321.77, "text": "key and the intended value."}, {"start_seconds": 320.13, "end_seconds": 324.13, "text": "This sequence separates missing tag"}, {"start_seconds": 321.77, "end_seconds": 327.25, "text": "coverage, incomplete activation, and"}, {"start_seconds": 324.13, "end_seconds": 327.25, "text": "delayed reporting data."}, {"start_seconds": 327.41, "end_seconds": 331.89, "text": "A team tagged EC2 resources with"}, {"start_seconds": 329.65, "end_seconds": 333.93, "text": "department equals operations,"}, {"start_seconds": 331.89, "end_seconds": 336.33, "text": "but department is unavailable as a Cost"}, {"start_seconds": 333.93, "end_seconds": 337.57, "text": "Explorer filter. What is the most likely"}, {"start_seconds": 336.33, "end_seconds": 339.33, "text": "missing step?"}, {"start_seconds": 337.57, "end_seconds": 341.13, "text": "Consider what converts a resource label"}, {"start_seconds": 339.33, "end_seconds": 343.13, "text": "into a billing dimension."}, {"start_seconds": 341.13, "end_seconds": 345.73, "text": "The correct answer is B, activate"}, {"start_seconds": 343.13, "end_seconds": 347.65, "text": "department under cost allocation tags."}, {"start_seconds": 345.73, "end_seconds": 348.93, "text": "Applying the tag was necessary, but"}, {"start_seconds": 347.65, "end_seconds": 350.61, "text": "activation in billing and cost"}, {"start_seconds": 348.93, "end_seconds": 353.57, "text": "management is what enables cost"}, {"start_seconds": 350.61, "end_seconds": 355.81, "text": "allocation reporting."}, {"start_seconds": 353.57, "end_seconds": 358.05, "text": "A quick decision guide reinforces the"}, {"start_seconds": 355.81, "end_seconds": 360.05, "text": "feature boundaries. For allocation by an"}, {"start_seconds": 358.05, "end_seconds": 362.41, "text": "internal business structure, use a"}, {"start_seconds": 360.05, "end_seconds": 364.13, "text": "user-defined tag such as department"}, {"start_seconds": 362.41, "end_seconds": 366.5, "text": "equals operations."}, {"start_seconds": 364.13, "end_seconds": 369.46, "text": "For creator-related attribution, use the"}, {"start_seconds": 366.5, "end_seconds": 371.33, "text": "AWS generated created by tag."}, {"start_seconds": 369.45, "end_seconds": 374.57, "text": "To inspect the resulting costs by tag"}, {"start_seconds": 371.33, "end_seconds": 376.53, "text": "key and value, use cost explorer."}, {"start_seconds": 374.57, "end_seconds": 378.53, "text": "To make an existing resource tag usable"}, {"start_seconds": 376.54, "end_seconds": 381.06, "text": "for cost reporting in the first place,"}, {"start_seconds": 378.54, "end_seconds": 383.98, "text": "use cost allocation tags in billing and"}, {"start_seconds": 381.06, "end_seconds": 385.89, "text": "cost management. Each tool or tag type"}, {"start_seconds": 383.98, "end_seconds": 388.46, "text": "has a distinct role in the overall"}, {"start_seconds": 385.89, "end_seconds": 388.45, "text": "workflow."}, {"start_seconds": 389.54, "end_seconds": 393.98, "text": "Consider two resources returned through"}, {"start_seconds": 391.74, "end_seconds": 396.78, "text": "creator based analysis."}, {"start_seconds": 393.98, "end_seconds": 399.06, "text": "One resource shows an IAM user."}, {"start_seconds": 396.77, "end_seconds": 401.53, "text": "That result can indicate a user identity"}, {"start_seconds": 399.06, "end_seconds": 403.5, "text": "associated with launching the resource."}, {"start_seconds": 401.54, "end_seconds": 404.58, "text": "The second resource shows an assumed"}, {"start_seconds": 403.5, "end_seconds": 406.01, "text": "role."}, {"start_seconds": 404.57, "end_seconds": 407.01, "text": "That does not make the result less"}, {"start_seconds": 406.01, "end_seconds": 408.65, "text": "useful."}, {"start_seconds": 407.01, "end_seconds": 410.45, "text": "It indicates the resource was launched"}, {"start_seconds": 408.65, "end_seconds": 412.53, "text": "through that role context."}, {"start_seconds": 410.45, "end_seconds": 413.97, "text": "If the role is used by CloudFormation,"}, {"start_seconds": 412.54, "end_seconds": 415.78, "text": "the attribution can point toward"}, {"start_seconds": 413.98, "end_seconds": 417.94, "text": "automated provisioning."}, {"start_seconds": 415.77, "end_seconds": 420.05, "text": "Interpreting a role value may therefore"}, {"start_seconds": 417.94, "end_seconds": 423.42, "text": "require understanding which automation"}, {"start_seconds": 420.06, "end_seconds": 425.86, "text": "or service uses the role."}, {"start_seconds": 423.42, "end_seconds": 427.86, "text": "A tag was activated yesterday, and"}, {"start_seconds": 425.86, "end_seconds": 429.98, "text": "tagged resources are confirmed, but"}, {"start_seconds": 427.86, "end_seconds": 431.22, "text": "related costs are still absent in cost"}, {"start_seconds": 429.98, "end_seconds": 433.14, "text": "explorer."}, {"start_seconds": 431.21, "end_seconds": 435.01, "text": "What is the best interpretation?"}, {"start_seconds": 433.13, "end_seconds": 436.18, "text": "Focus on the expected delay described in"}, {"start_seconds": 435.01, "end_seconds": 438.41, "text": "this workflow."}, {"start_seconds": 436.18, "end_seconds": 440.81, "text": "The best answer is C. Activation and"}, {"start_seconds": 438.42, "end_seconds": 442.42, "text": "reporting data may require more time."}, {"start_seconds": 440.81, "end_seconds": 444.21, "text": "Do not immediately assume that tagging"}, {"start_seconds": 442.42, "end_seconds": 446.3, "text": "failed or that the resource must be"}, {"start_seconds": 444.21, "end_seconds": 448.21, "text": "recreated. Validate the tag and"}, {"start_seconds": 446.3, "end_seconds": 451.06, "text": "activation status, then account for"}, {"start_seconds": 448.21, "end_seconds": 451.05, "text": "processing time."}, {"start_seconds": 451.62, "end_seconds": 456.1, "text": "To summarize, apply tags to resources"}, {"start_seconds": 454.13, "end_seconds": 457.53, "text": "before expecting tag based cost"}, {"start_seconds": 456.1, "end_seconds": 459.62, "text": "analysis."}, {"start_seconds": 457.54, "end_seconds": 461.9, "text": "Then activate the desired tag in billing"}, {"start_seconds": 459.62, "end_seconds": 463.3, "text": "and cost management as a cost allocation"}, {"start_seconds": 461.89, "end_seconds": 464.94, "text": "tag."}, {"start_seconds": 463.3, "end_seconds": 466.9, "text": "For department reporting, use an"}, {"start_seconds": 464.94, "end_seconds": 469.57, "text": "organization defined tag, such as"}, {"start_seconds": 466.89, "end_seconds": 471.29, "text": "department equals operations."}, {"start_seconds": 469.57, "end_seconds": 474.25, "text": "For attribution to a launching identity"}, {"start_seconds": 471.3, "end_seconds": 475.57, "text": "or role, use the AWS generated created"}, {"start_seconds": 474.25, "end_seconds": 477.77, "text": "by tag."}, {"start_seconds": 475.57, "end_seconds": 480.18, "text": "In cost explorer, select both the tag"}, {"start_seconds": 477.77, "end_seconds": 481.81, "text": "key and its relevant value."}, {"start_seconds": 480.18, "end_seconds": 484.54, "text": "When results are missing, verify"}, {"start_seconds": 481.81, "end_seconds": 488.54, "text": "tagging, verify activation, and allow"}, {"start_seconds": 484.54, "end_seconds": 488.54, "text": "time for cost data to become available."}, {"start_seconds": 488.98, "end_seconds": 492.62, "text": "Like, share, and subscribe for more"}, {"start_seconds": 490.78, "end_seconds": 494.14, "text": "certification training. Visit"}, {"start_seconds": 492.62, "end_seconds": 496.18, "text": "techstudydeck.com"}, {"start_seconds": 494.14, "end_seconds": 498.26, "text": "and use the free companion study guide,"}, {"start_seconds": 496.18, "end_seconds": 502.62, "text": "flash cards, and practice questions to"}, {"start_seconds": 498.26, "end_seconds": 502.62, "text": "reinforce AWS cost allocation tags."}]}